# Owner of the paths where a mistake costs the most: permissions, sign-in,
# media encryption, the media server, outbound requests, release and update
# verification, backup and restore, CI, and the rules agents read; and the
# paths that held the heaviest defects of the 2026-11 defect hunt (the SFU,
# automod's link rules and the client's link reader they must match, the audit
# log's visibility, the plain text of pushes and snippets, the write gates of
# messages, conversations and poll votes).
#
# This file has no effect by itself. GitHub requests a review from the owner,
# but a pull request only waits for it once main's ruleset has "Require review
# from Code Owners" turned on, which is a repository setting.

